     "explanation": "The core innovation of Content Inc. is **inverting the traditional path**. Most startups build a product first and then scramble to find customers. Content Inc. entrepreneurs first build a loyal audience around a focused topic, then introduce products the audience actually wants. This collapses customer-acquisition cost and dramatically lowers startup risk.",
