     "explanation": "Pulizzi names **quitting too early** as the #1 killer. The Content Inc. model has a slow first 6-12 months by design — search engines, algorithms, and trust all take time to compound. Almost everyone quits before the inflection point. Those who survive 12-18 months of consistent publishing pass through the patience tax and reach the steep growth curve. The other answers (platform, ideas, ads) are tactical issues; quitting is the strategic killer.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">The #1 killer of Content Inc. businesses</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"180\" width=\"900\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">QUITTING TOO EARLY</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Most quit before month 12</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"335\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">When SEO, trust, and audience finally compound</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"420\" width=\"900\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.1)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"485\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE PATIENCE TAX</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"535\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">12-18 months of consistent publishing</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"575\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Before growth compounds and revenue follows</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"660\" width=\"900\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"720\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">SURVIVE THE TAX</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"770\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">You beat 95% of competitors automatically.</text>\n                </svg>",
      "caption": "Patience is the strategic weapon"
     }
