     "explanation": "The 100-titles-in-30-minutes test is a stress test for **content sustainability**. If you can't generate 100 ideas quickly, one of two things is true: (a) the niche is so narrow it'll run out of fresh angles within months, or (b) you don't actually have enough depth to sustain it. Both mean you need to widen the topic slightly or go deepen your knowledge before committing. The fix isn't switching formats — it's revisiting the Sweet Spot itself.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">The 100-titles test</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"180\" width=\"900\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">CAN'T GET TO 100</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"285\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Two diagnoses, never both</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Topic too narrow OR knowledge too thin</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"360\" width=\"430\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.1)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"315\" y=\"420\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">FIX 1</text>\n                    <text x=\"315\" y=\"470\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Widen the topic</text>\n                    <text x=\"315\" y=\"510\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Move up one specificity level</text>\n                    <text x=\"315\" y=\"545\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Add adjacent themes</text>\n                    <rect x=\"570\" y=\"360\" width=\"430\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"785\" y=\"420\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">FIX 2</text>\n                    <text x=\"785\" y=\"470\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Deepen your knowledge</text>\n                    <text x=\"785\" y=\"510\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Spend 90 days obsessing</text>\n                    <text x=\"785\" y=\"545\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Then retest</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"620\" width=\"900\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"680\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">DON'T SKIP THIS</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"725\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">A bad Sweet Spot kills the whole model</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"760\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Better to fix it now than burn out in month 4</text>\n                </svg>",
      "caption": "The 100-title diagnosis"
     }
