      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">YOUR AUDIENCE SURVEY</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Five questions. No more.</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"180\" width=\"900\" height=\"130\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"170\" y=\"235\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">Q1</text>\n                    <text x=\"230\" y=\"230\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Biggest struggle?</text>\n                    <text x=\"230\" y=\"275\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Open text. Surfaces real pain.</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"330\" width=\"900\" height=\"130\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"170\" y=\"385\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">Q2</text>\n                    <text x=\"230\" y=\"380\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">What would make a solution irresistible?</text>\n                    <text x=\"230\" y=\"425\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Open text. Shapes the offering.</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"480\" width=\"900\" height=\"130\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"170\" y=\"535\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">Q3</text>\n                    <text x=\"230\" y=\"530\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Format preference?</text>\n                    <text x=\"230\" y=\"575\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Multiple choice. Reveals what they'll buy.</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"630\" width=\"900\" height=\"130\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"170\" y=\"685\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">Q4</text>\n                    <text x=\"230\" y=\"680\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Realistic price point?</text>\n                    <text x=\"230\" y=\"725\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Multiple choice with tiers. Anchors pricing.</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"780\" width=\"900\" height=\"130\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"170\" y=\"835\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">Q5</text>\n                    <text x=\"230\" y=\"830\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Open to a 30-min call?</text>\n                    <text x=\"230\" y=\"875\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Optional name+email. Surfaces superfans.</text>\n                </svg>",
      "caption": "Five questions. Maximum signal."
