     "explanation": "The through-line is **standalone value**. A farmer used Deere's crop advice even in a year he bought a rival's plow; a driver used the Michelin Guide in a rental car; a fan watched SportsCenter on a night with no games worth caring about. None of it depended on internet-era distribution — Deere and Michelin proved the pattern decades before radio, let alone the web. What made the content durable was that it stood on its own merits.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"32\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"21\">What made the classics last a century</text>\n<rect x=\"100\" y=\"180\" width=\"900\" height=\"220\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.1)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">STANDALONE VALUE</text>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"285\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"20\">Useful or entertaining even if you</text>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"318\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"20\">never buy the underlying product</text>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"360\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"17\">This is the opposite of a disguised advertisement</text>\n<rect x=\"100\" y=\"440\" width=\"430\" height=\"180\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"315\" y=\"495\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">NOT THE ANSWER</text>\n<text x=\"315\" y=\"535\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"17\">Bigger ad budgets</text>\n<text x=\"315\" y=\"570\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"17\">or lucky timing</text>\n<rect x=\"570\" y=\"440\" width=\"430\" height=\"180\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.1)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"785\" y=\"495\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">THE ANSWER</text>\n<text x=\"785\" y=\"535\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"17\">Content worth having</text>\n<text x=\"785\" y=\"570\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"17\">on its own terms</text>\n<rect x=\"100\" y=\"660\" width=\"900\" height=\"110\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"550\" y=\"720\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"19\">Deere and Michelin proved it before the internet existed</text>\n</svg>",
      "caption": "Test your understanding"
     }
